//Regression: calling a name that resolves nowhere used to crash ncc
//with an access violation. FindFuncByInvoke's FFR_FuncNameNotFound path
//returned without writing the out-param, so Access(SnInvokeExpr) read a
//garbage SnFunction* off the stack. Must be a clean compile error.
import lib;

int main() {
	return natGhostX(20);
}
